{"title":"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many different isosceles triangles have integer side lengths and perimeter 23?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/f/bcf144f66e351ca34c0e18b7cb904db8e825f8a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 9\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be the base of the isosceles triangles, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the lengths of the other legs. From this, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/586750d879946c2341314b2c688277a5a7c11ec1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a+b=23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/6/866df4891c18f0224a406280650773cda7e4c937.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=23-2a$\" width=\"91\" height=\"12\" />. From triangle inequality, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/0/ba054e74b36a27d6a0d196d64e0e3b3a6be04068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a&gt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />, then plug in the value from the previous equation to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/9/79970b97b38350611861eeb99185c5c8228ffc39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a&gt;23-2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"102\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b12f85144b1835764601c50f856e3d990aea4f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;5.75$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"65\" height=\"13\" />. The maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, in which from the first equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/3867a5832ef0c48a7a8666d9a63100c86146632d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> can have integer side lengths from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a536e34c10b022c7892c89afd52a136d7a61695d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"56\" height=\"30\" /> triangles.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/DGUZn2BMuiE\">https://youtu.be/DGUZn2BMuiE</a>   Soo, DRMS, NM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8\" title=\"2005 AMC 8\">2005 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2005\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?